+++ b/changelog/70129.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Added ``beacons.status`` execution module function to report, per configured
+beacon, when it last fired and whether that run raised an error. Status is
+tracked live in memory as beacons run, so no probe cycle, log access, or
+minion restart is required, and beacons that have never fired are reported
+as such.
